WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Your Bay Area. In one place. 101 cities. Nine counties. A closer look at local change.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Start with your neighborhood. Explore nearby projects and local resources.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.500
See what is being built. Browse proposals and follow the public records.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:10.000
Follow the way we move. Roads, transit and projects that connect communities.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.500
Put the numbers in context. Compare housing, population and transportation data.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.000
Explore what could change. Housing scenarios, policy, flood exposure and energy. Illustrative scenarios, not forecasts.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.500
Keep up with local decisions. Read community updates and monthly editions.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:20.000
Follow the conversation. Find meeting sources and tools to summarize them.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.500
Find your way to take part. Explore boards, meetings and participation options.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:25.000
Go straight to the source. Find official civic resources across the Bay Area.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.500
Bring your local questions. Ask about projects, meetings and planning in your city.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:30.000
Keep what matters to you. Follow your interests. Come back to your neighborhood.

